    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const bookingData = $input.item.json;\n\nlet conversationHistory = [];\n\nif (bookingData.conversation_history && bookingData.conversation_history !== '') {\n  try {\n    conversationHistory = JSON.parse(bookingData.conversation_history);\n  } catch (e) {\n    conversationHistory = [];\n  }\n}\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ...bookingData,\n    parsed_conversation_history: conversationHistory\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "f1978f4c-cb77-4b93-aeed-e1a212cb04ac",
      "name": "Parse Conversation History",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -976,
        2096
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Guest message: {{ $('Workflow Configuration').item.json.guest_message }}\n\nBooking Details:\n- Guest Name: {{ $('Get Booking Data').item.json.guest_name }}\n- Property: {{ $('Get Property Data').item.json.property_name }}\n- Check-in: {{ $('Get Booking Data').item.json.check_in }}\n- Check-out: {{ $('Get Booking Data').item.json.check_out }}\n- Number of Guests: {{ $('Get Booking Data').item.json.number_of_guests }}\n\nProperty Information:\n- Address: {{ $('Get Property Data').item.json.address }}\n- WiFi Network: {{ $('Get Property Data').item.json.wifi_network }}\n- WiFi Password: {{ $('Get Property Data').item.json.wifi_password }}\n- Door Code: {{ $('Get Property Data').item.json.door_code }}\n- Lockbox Location: {{ $('Get Property Data').item.json.lockbox_location }}\n- Parking: {{ $('Get Property Data').item.json.parking_instructions }}\n- Check-in Time: {{ $('Get Property Data').item.json.check_in_time }}\n- Check-out Time: {{ $('Get Property Data').item.json.check_out_time }}\n- House Rules: {{ $('Get Property Data').item.json.house_rules }}\n\nConversation History:\n{{ JSON.stringify($('Parse Conversation History').item.json.parsed_conversation_history) }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a professional property manager assistant helping current and upcoming guests with their stay.\n\nYour role is to provide helpful, friendly assistance while following strict escalation rules for requests that require approval or action.\n\n**ESCALATION RULES - You MUST respond with these exact control signals:**\n\n1. **CREATE_MAINTENANCE** - For broken items, malfunctions, or maintenance issues\n   - Format: control_signal=\"CREATE_MAINTENANCE\", metadata=\"[category]:[description]\"\n   - Example: Broken AC, leaking faucet, damaged furniture\n\n2. **REQUEST_SUPPLIES** - For supply requests\n   - Format: control_signal=\"REQUEST_SUPPLIES\", metadata=\"[items]\"\n   - Example: Towels, toiletries, toilet paper, cleaning supplies\n\n3. **CHECK_EXTENSION** - For stay extension requests\n   - Format: control_signal=\"CHECK_EXTENSION\", metadata=\"[current_checkout]:[requested_checkout]\"\n\n4. **LATE_CHECKOUT** - For late checkout requests\n   - Format: control_signal=\"LATE_CHECKOUT\", metadata=\"[requested_time]\"\n\n5. **EARLY_CHECKOUT** - For early departure\n   - Format: control_signal=\"EARLY_CHECKOUT\", metadata=\"[departure_date]\"\n\n6. **MID_STAY_CLEANING** - For mid-stay cleaning requests\n   - Format: control_signal=\"MID_STAY_CLEANING\", metadata=\"[requested_date]\"\n\n7. **ESCALATE_TO_CONTACT** - For other requests needing approval\n   - Format: control_signal=\"ESCALATE_TO_CONTACT\", metadata=\"[reason]\"\n\n**SPECIAL CASE - Guest Locked Out:**\nIf guest is locked out or asking for door code urgently, provide the door code immediately with control_signal=\"NONE\"\n\n**For all other questions:**\n- Provide helpful answers about the property, WiFi, parking, check-in procedures, local tips, house rules\n- Keep responses under 150 words\n- Be friendly and professional\n- Use control_signal=\"NONE\" and put your response in response_text\n\nAlways include the appropriate control_signal, response_text, and metadata fields in your structured output."
        }
      },
